<div class="section_content content" id="7684841_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Beginning at a point in the center line of Delaware Avenue where it is intersected by the center line of Second Avenue; thence southerly along the center line of Delaware Avenue to a point 166.82 feet south of the southwest corner of Mereline Avenue and Delaware Avenue; thence westerly along a line parallel to Mereline Avenue to the City line at Stanford Court; thence southerly along the City line to the Normanskill; thence easterly along the City line to the Hudson River; thence northerly along the City line in the Hudson River to a point where it is intersected by the easterly prolongation of Gansevoort Street; thence westerly along Gansevoort Street to the center line of South Pearl Street; thence northerly along the center line of South Pearl Street to the center line of Fourth Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Fourth Avenue to the center line of Elizabeth Street; thence southerly along the center line of Elizabeth Street to the center line of Third Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of Third Avenue to the center line of Broad Street; thence southerly along the center line of Broad Street to the center line of Seymour Street; thence westerly along the center line of Seymour Street to the center line of Krank Street; thence southerly along the center line of Krank Street to the center line of First Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of First Avenue to a point where it intersects the southerly extension of Regent Street; thence northerly along the center line of Regent Street to the center line of Second Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Second Avenue to the center line of Dove Street; thence northerly along the center line of Dove Street to its intersection with a line drawn from the intersection of Hawk Street and Third Avenue to the intersection of O'Connell Street and Anne Street; thence westerly along said line to the intersection of O'Connell Street and Anne Street; thence southerly along the center line of O'Connell Street to the center line of Garden Street; thence westerly along the center line of Garden Street to the center line of Hurlbut Street; thence northerly along the center line of Hurlbut Street to the rear line of the lots fronting on Delaware Avenue; thence westerly along said rear lot line to the rear line of the lots fronting on Hurlbut Street; thence southerly along the rear line of lots fronting on Hurlbut Street to the rear line of the lots fronting on Second Avenue; thence easterly along said rear lot lines to the center line of Hurlbut Street; thence southerly along the center line of Hurlbut Street to the center line of Second Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Second Avenue to the center line of Delaware Avenue, the place and point of beginning.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
