<div class="section_content content" id="7684842_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Beginning at a point in the center line of Broad Street where it is intersected by the center line of Third Avenue; thence southerly along the center line of Broad Street to the center line of Seymour Street; thence westerly along the center line of Seymour Street to the center line of Krank Street; thence southerly along the center line of Krank Street to the center line of First Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of First Avenue to the southerly extension of the center line of Regent Street; thence northerly along the center line of Regent Street to the center line of Second Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Second Avenue to the center line of Dove Street; thence northerly along the center line of Dove Street to its intersection with a line drawn from the intersection of South Hawk Street and Third Avenue to the intersection of O'Connell Street and Anne Street; thence easterly along said line to the intersection of South Hawk Street and Third Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of Third Avenue to a point in the southerly extension of Eagle Street; thence northerly along said extension and the center line of Eagle Street to a point in the westerly extension of Warren Street in Lincoln Park; thence easterly along said extension and the center line of Warren Street to the center line of Grand Street; thence northerly along the center line of Grand Street to the center line of Arch Street; thence easterly along the center line of Arch Street to the center line of South Pearl Street; thence southerly along the center line of South Pearl Street to the center line of Fourth Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Fourth Avenue to the center line of Elizabeth Street; thence southerly along the center line of Elizabeth Street to the center line of Third Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of Third Avenue to the center line of Broad Street, the place and point of beginning.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
