<div class="section_content content" id="7684844_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Beginning at a point in the center line of Eagle Street where it is intersected by the center line of Hudson Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of Hudson Avenue to the center line of Philip Street; thence southerly along the center line of Philip Street to the center line of Myrtle Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Myrtle Avenue to the center line of Eagle Street; thence southerly along the center line of Eagle Street to the center line of Third Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Third Avenue to the center line of South Hawk Street; thence southwesterly along a straight line to a point in the center line of O'Connell Street at Anne Street; thence southeasterly along the center line of O'Connell Street to the center line of Garden Street; thence southwesterly along the center line of Garden Street to the center line of Hurlbut Street; thence northwesterly along the center line of Hurlbut Street to a point in the rear lot line of lots fronting on Delaware Avenue; thence southerly along said rear lot lines to its intersection with the rear line of the lots fronting on Hurlbut Street; thence southeasterly along said rear lot lines to a point in the rear line of lots fronting on Second Avenue; thence northerly along said rear line to the center line of Hurlbut Street; thence easterly along the center line of Hurlbut Street to the center line of Second Avenue; thence southwesterly along the center line of Second Avenue to the center line of Delaware Avenue; thence northerly along the center line of Delaware Avenue to the center line of Cuyler Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Cuyler Avenue to the rear line of lots fronting on Delaware Avenue; thence southerly along said rear line to the rear line of the lots fronting on Cuyler Avenue; thence westerly along the rear line of the lots fronting on Cuyler Avenue to the center li