<div class="section_content content" id="7684845_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Beginning at a point in the center line of Madison Avenue where it is intersected by the center line of Eagle Street; thence westerly along the center line of Madison Avenue to the center line of South Lake Avenue; thence northerly along the center line of South Lake Avenue to the center line of Western Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of Western Avenue to the center line of State Street; thence continuing easterly along the center line of State Street to the center line of Sprague Place; thence northerly along the center line of Sprague Place to the center line of Washington Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Washington Avenue to the center line of Lexington Avenue; thence northerly along the center line of Lexington Avenue to the center line of Central Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of Central Avenue to the center line of Northern Boulevard; thence northerly along the center line of Northern Boulevard to the rear line of the lots fronting on Central Avenue; thence easterly along said rear lot lines to the center line of Lark Street; thence northerly along the center line of Lark Street to the center line of Spruce Street; thence easterly along the center line of Spruce Street to the center line of Eagle Street; thence northerly along the center line of Eagle Street to the center line of Sheridan Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of Sheridan Avenue to the center line of North Pearl Street; thence southerly along the center line of North Pearl Street to the center line of Columbia Street; thence easterly along the center line of Columbia Street and its easterly extension to a point in the City line in the Hudson River; thence southerly along the City line to its intersection with the easterly extension of the center line of State Street; thence westerly along said extension and the center line of State Street to the center line of South Pearl Street; thence southerly along the center line of South Pearl Street to the center line of Beaver Street; thence westerly along the center line of Beaver Street to the center line of Eagle Street; thence southerly along the center line of Eagle Street to the center line of Madison Avenue the point and place of beginning.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
