<div class="section_content content" id="7684846_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Beginning at a point in the center line of Sheridan Avenue where it is intersected by the center line of Chapel Street; thence westerly along the center line of Sheridan Avenue to the center line of Eagle Street; thence southerly along the center line of Eagle Street to the center line of Spruce Street; thence westerly along the center line of Spruce Street to the center line of Lark Street; thence southerly along the center line of Lark Street to the rear line of the lots fronting on the south side of Sherman Street; thence westerly along said rear lot line to the center line of Northern Boulevard; thence southerly along the center line of Northern Boulevard to the center line of Central Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Central Avenue to the center line of Lexington Avenue; thence southerly along the center line of Lexington Avenue to the center line of Washington Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of Washington Avenue to the center line of Sprague Place; thence southerly along the center line of Sprague Place to the center line of State Street; thence westerly along the center line of State Street to the center line of Western Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Western Avenue to the center line of Ontario Street; thence northerly along the center line of Ontario Street to the center line of Washington Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of Washington Avenue to the center line of Quail Street; thence northerly along the center line of Quail Street to the center line of Bradford Street; thence easterly along the center line of Bradford Street to the center line of North Lake Avenue; thence southerly along the center line of North Lake Avenue to the center line of West Street; thence easterly along the center line of West Street to the center line of Robin Street; thence northerly along the center line of Robin Street to the center line of Elk Street; thence westerly along the center line of Elk Street to the center line of North Lake Avenue; thence northerly along the center line of North Lake Avenue to the center line of Clinton Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of Clinton Avenue to the center line of Lexington Street; thence southerly along the center line of Lexington Avenue to the center line of Sheridan Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of Sheridan Avenue to the center line of Northern Boulevard; thence northerly along the center line of Northern Boulevard to the center line of Orange Street; thence easterly along the center line of Orange Street to the center line of Lark Street; thence northerly along the center line of Lark Street the center line of Clinton Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of Clinton Avenue to the center line of Chapel Street; thence southerly along the center line of Chapel Street to the center line of Sheridan Avenue the place and point of beginning.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
