<div class="section_content content" id="7684847_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Beginning at a point in the center line of Broadway where it is intersected by the center line of Livingston Avenue; thence southerly along the center line of Broadway to the center line of Columbia Street; thence westerly along the center line of Columbia Street to the center line of North Pearl Street; thence northerly along the center line of North Pearl Street to the center line of Sheridan Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Sheridan Avenue to the center line of Chapel Street; thence northerly along the center line of Chapel Street to the center line of Clinton Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Clinton Avenue to the center line of Lark Street; thence northerly along the center line of Lark Street to the center line of Third Street; thence easterly along the center line of Third Street to the rear line of the lots fronting on the west side of North Swan Street; thence northerly along said rear lot lines to the rear line of the lots fronting on the south side of Livingston Avenue; thence westerly along the said rear line of lots fronting on Livingston Avenue to the center line of Lark Street; thence northerly along the center line of Lark Street to the center line of Colonie Street; thence easterly along the center line of Colonie Street to the center line of North Swan Street; thence northerly along the center line of North Swan Street to the rear line of lots fronting on Colonie Street; thence easterly along said rear lot lines to the center line of North Pearl Street; thence southerly along the center line of North Pearl Street to the center line of Livingston Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of Livingston Avenue to the center line of Broadway, the place and point of beginning.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
