<div class="section_content content" id="7684848_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Beginning at a point in the center line of Clinton Avenue where it is intersected by the center line of Lark Street from the north; thence westerly along the center line of Clinton Avenue to the center line of Lark Street to the south; thence southerly along the center line of Lark Street to the center line of Orange Street; thence westerly along the center line of Orange Street to the center line of Northern Boulevard; thence southerly along the center line of Northern Boulevard to the center line of Sheridan Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Sheridan Avenue to the center line of Lexington Avenue; thence northerly along the center line of Lexington Avenue to the center line of Second Street; thence westerly along the center line of Second Street to the center line of Thornton Street; thence northerly along the center line of Thornton Street to the center line of Third Street; thence easterly along the center line of Third Street to the center line of Northern Boulevard; thence northerly along the center line of Northern Boulevard to the center line of Livingston Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Livingston Avenue to the center line of Thornton Street; thence northerly along the center line of Thornton Street to the center line of McCrossin Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of McCrossin Avenue to the center line of Northern Boulevard; thence northerly along the center line of Northern Boulevard to Patroon's Creek; thence easterly along Patroon's Creek to a point where it is intersected by the northerly extension of the center line of Lark Street; thence southerly along said extension and the center line of Lark Street to the north boundary line of Albany Housing Project No. 9-1; thence easterly and southerly along the boundary lines of said Housing Project to a point in the rear line of the lots on the north side of Colonie Street