<div class="section_content content" id="7684858_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Beginning at a point in the center line of North Pine Avenue where it is intersected by the center line of Washington Avenue; thence southerly along the center line of North Pine Avenue to the center line of Western Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Western Avenue to the center line of Euclid Avenue; thence southerly along the center line of Euclid Avenue to the center line of New Scotland Avenue; thence continuing southerly along the center line of New Scotland Avenue to its junction with the southerly City line; thence westerly and northerly along the City line to an angle in the City line on the south side of Krumkill Road; thence westerly along the City line on the south side of Krumkill Road to an angle in Krumkill Road; thence continuing westerly along the center line of Krumkill Road to the center line of Endicott Avenue; thence northerly along the center line of Endicott Avenue to the center line of Waltham Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Waltham Avenue to the center line of Oliver Avenue; thence northerly along the center line of Oliver Avenue to the center line of Huron Street; thence easterly along the center line of Huron Street to the center line of Pinehurst Avenue; thence northerly along the center line of Pinehurst Avenue to the center line of Greenway; thence easterly along the center line of Greenway to the center line of Ormond Street; thence northerly along the center line of Ormond Street to the center line of Western Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Western Avenue to the eastern boundary line of the State Campus Site; thence northerly along said boundary line to a point in the rear of the lots on the north side of Western Avenue; thence easterly along said rear lot lines to the rear line of the lots on the west side of Brevator Street; thence northerly along the rear of the lots on the west side of Brevator Street to the boundary line of the State Campus Site; thence easterly along said boundary to the center line of Brevator Street; thence northerly along the center line of Brevator Street to the center line of Hawkins Street; thence easterly along the center line of Hawkins Street to the center line of Hawthorne Avenue; thence northerly along the center line of Hawthorne Avenue to the center line of Washington Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of Washington Avenue to the center line of North Pine Avenue the point and place of beginning.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
