<div class="section_content content" id="7684859_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Beginning at a point in the center line of Washington Avenue where it is intersected by the center line of Winthrop Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Washington Avenue to the center line of Hawthorne Avenue; thence southerly along the center line of Hawthorne Avenue to the center line of Hawkins Street; thence westerly along the center line of Hawkins Street to the center line of Brevator Street; thence southerly along the center line of Brevator Street to the north line of the lots on the west side of Brevator Street; thence westerly along said lot line to the rear line of the lots on the west side of Brevator Street; thence southerly along said rear lot lines to the rear line of the lots on the north side of Western Avenue; thence westerly along the rear line of the lots on the north side of Western Avenue to the west line of said lots; thence southerly along said west lot line to the center line of Western Avenue: thence easterly along the center line of Western Avenue to the center line of Ormond Street; thence southerly along the center line of Ormond Street to the center line of Greenway; thence westerly along the center line of Greenway to the center line of Pinehurst Avenue; thence southerly along the center line of Pinehurst Avenue to the center line of Huron Avenue; thence westerly along the center line of Huron Avenue to the center line of Oliver Avenue; thence southerly along the center line of Oliver Avenue to the center line of Waltham Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of Waltham Avenue to the center line of Endicott Avenue; thence southerly along the center line of Endicott Avenue to the center line of Krumkill Road; thence easterly along the Krumkill Road to its intersection with the southerly City line; thence southerly and westerly along the City line to the Krumkill; thence westerly and northerly along the City line in the Krumkill to Western Avenue; thence northerly and continuing along the City line to an angle in the City line; thence westerly continuing along the City line to the southwest corner of the western extension of the City; thence northeasterly along the west City line to the northwest corner of the western extension of the City; thence easterly and continuing along the north City line to its intersection with the old City line; thence southerly along the old City line to its intersection with the westerly extension of the center line of Clinton Avenue; thence easterly along said extension and the center line of Clinton Avenue to the center line of Colvin Avenue; thence southerly along the center line of Colvin Avenue to the center line of Lincoln Avenue; thence easterly along the center line of Lincoln Avenue to the center line of Winthrop Avenue; thence southerly along the center line of Winthrop Avenue to the center line of Washington Avenue, the point and place of beginning.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
